{icon:BossPower_B_Icon, 2}{if:SF_19}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Main{/c}
When you Cast an {c_important}Agility{/c}, {c_important}Defensive{/c}, or {c_important}Macabre{/c} skill, spawn a crystal that Taunts enemies and explodes after {c_number}{SF_1}{/c} seconds, dealing {c_random}{payload:DAMAGE_TOOLTIP}{/c} Shadow damage.{if:SF_19}{/c}{/if} 

{icon:BossPower_A_Icon, 2}{if:SF_18}{c_gray}{/if} {c_label}Modifier{/c}
Activating your {c_important}Main{/c} Boss Power Fears Nearby enemies for {c_number}[{SF_9}|2|]{/c} seconds and deals {c_random}{payload:SUBVERSION_DAMAGE_TOOLTIP}{/c} Shadow damage to them.{if:SF_18}{/c}{/if}
